  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-11-20 (in session): canonicalize via imports. Per file, using local information only: a type name the file imports (import x.y.Foo, use std::fmt) or a language-implicit one (java.lang, Kotlin/Scala default imports) is rewritten to its full path before hashing, so both spellings hash alike. Names that cannot be resolved locally stay as written; distinct same-named types stay distinct. Rejected: last segment only (collapses a.Foo and b.Foo); keep as written and close."  # da27
